{
  "slug": "spritecook",
  "name": "Spritecook",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Generate game art from Claude. Adds the SpriteCook MCP server for creating pixel art sprites, textures, and animations, plus guided skills for sprite sheets, tilesets, and icon packs.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **8 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (8): `spritecook-animate-assets` (Animation guide for SpriteCook), `spritecook-generate-sprites` (Still-image generation guide for SpriteCook), `spritecook-generate-tilesets` (Tileset generation guide for SpriteCook), `spritecook-upload-assets` (Upload local image files into SpriteCook through MCP without API keys or base64 logs), `spritecook-use-assets-in-godot` (Godot workflow for SpriteCook assets), `spritecook-use-dual-grid-tilesets` (Implementation guide for using SpriteCook top-down 15-piece tilesets with a dual-grid autotile renderer), `spritecook-use-presets` (Use SpriteCook saved presets through MCP), `spritecook-workflow-essentials` (Shared workflow rules for SpriteCook)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `spritecook`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install spritecook@claude-community` from `SpriteCook/spritecook-claude-plugin`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 8,
    "mcp": 1
  },
